blocks.en:
Our key contributions are summarized as follows:
(i) we repurpose a video generator into a feed-forward 4D perceiver under sparse query supervision, offering an alternative to GFM-based methods;
(ii) we introduce a continuous-time query mechanism together with on-demand decoding to provide temporal and spatial flexibility;
(iii) we incorporate a frozen depth LoRA as a plug-in geometry prior , improving overall 4D reconstruction without adding trainable parameters; and
(iv) we provide a comprehensive evaluation of our method on a set of 4D reconstruction tasks, complemented by qualitative results on in-the-wild videos, demonstrating its effectiveness and generalization.

blocks.zh:
我们的主要贡献概述如下:
(一) 在有限的查询监督下,我们将一个视频生成器重新用于向导的4D感应器,为基于GFM的方法提供替代品;
(二) 我们采用一个连续时间查询机制,同时进行点播解码,以提供时间和空间的灵活性;
(三) 我们把冷冻的LORA深度作为插孔几何前,改进整体4D重建,但不增加可训练参数;
(四)我们全面评价我们一套4D重建任务的方法,辅以对全网视频的定性结果,展示其有效性和概括性.
